  "job_B3.3.11_20251003_114653": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00e6s, S\u00e6inte Jacob Se halge Jacobus him andswerode, On mines Drihtenes name H\u00e6lendes Cristes, \u00fee onhangen w\u00e6s on He \u00fe\u00e6rrihte aras, & ongann blissigende eornen. & bletsigen Drihtenes name H\u00e6lendes Cristes. \u00dea se sunderhalge Josias \u00fe\u00e6t geseh, \u00fee hine \u00e6r to beheafdunge gel\u00e6dde, ongann feallen to Jacobes \u00dea undergeat se halge Jacobus \u00fe\u00e6t his heorte w\u00e6s geneosod fram \u00fean \u00e6lmihtigan Gode, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Josias andswerode, Ic gelefe, & \u00fe\u00e6t is min geleafe nu o\u00f0\u00f0 \u00feysne time \u00fe\u00e6t he is \u00fe\u00e6s lyfigendan Godes \u00dea w\u00e6s eall \u00feiss gecy\u00f0d \u00fean ealdorbiscope, \u00fee Abiathar hatte, & he let \u00fea geh\u00e6ften Josiam & him to Josias andswerode, Aweregod beo \u00feu & ealle \u00feine lease godes, for \u00fean \u00fee \u00feu awendest \u00fee fram \u00fe\u00e6s Mines Drihtenes name, so\u00f0lice H\u00e6lendes Cristes \u00fee Jacobus bode\u00f0, is gebletsod on ecnysse. \u00dea het Abiathar beaten his mu\u00f0 \u00feearle swy\u00f0e, & hine sy\u00f0\u00f0en s\u00e6nde to Heroden, & gewrit mid him \u00dea heo becomen so\u00f0lice to \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00fe\u00e6r me hine beheafdigen scolde, \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Sanctus Jacobus to Se halge Jacobus cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Josiam, Gelyfst \u00feu on ures Drihtenes namen H\u00e6lendes Cristes \u00fe\u00e6s He andswerode, Ic gelefe. Se halge Jacobus hine begeat \u00fea mid \u00fean w\u00e6tere & him to cw\u00e6\u00f0, Forgyf me sibbne coss. Mid \u00fean \u00fee Josias hine cyss",
